<h1>Install DevToolkit</h1><p>DevToolkit is an open-source CLI for scaffolding projects. Run the official installer in your terminal:</p>
<pre id="cmd">curl -fsSL https://get.devtoolkit.io/install.sh | sh</pre><button id="copy">Copy</button>
<p>The installer is open source; read it on GitHub before running. Prefer Homebrew? <code>brew install devtoolkit</code>.</p>
<script>document.getElementById("copy").onclick = () => navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById("cmd").textContent);</script>
